FATAL_OBJECTIONS:
- [novelty_killer, unrebutted] Core mechanism ("prefix-family-aware batch admission co-scheduling requests sharing a prefix to maximize cache reuse before eviction") is verbatim SGLang RadixAttention cache-aware scheduling (Zheng et al., NeurIPS 2024, 2312.07104) — a canonical, shipping system. Independently corroborated by systems_reviewer citing SGLang §5.2 and by vLLM APC, Preble (2407.00023), and llm-d. The researcher's own packet concedes this overlap ("this experiment's contribution is narrowly the matched-fairness control... not the idea of cache-aware admission itself"). The claim AS WRITTEN claims the mechanism, not just the fairness measurement.
- [novelty_killer, unrebutted] Residual novelty (bounded reorder window W with p99 cap) is a thin composition of two known techniques: cache-aware admission (SGLang/vLLM/Preble) + aging/starvation-bounded scheduling, of which VTC (Sheng et al., OSDI 2024, 2401.00588) is the LLM-serving instance. No reviewer rebutted this composition argument. The L0 does not compare against VTC or SGLang's actual scheduler — only against naive FCFS, which evaluation_prosecutor independently flags as a strawman risk.
- [theory_skeptic, unaddressed] The 15/92 "clean CI<0 wins" across 92 cells with no FWER/FDR correction have an expected false-positive count of ~4–5 under the null at nominal 95%. Combined with n=6 seeds per cell (below the ≥20 rule of thumb for bootstrap CI stability), the statistical authority of the win count is weakened. Wins concentrate in one regime, which helps, but a corrected analysis is owed.

REQUIRED_EVIDENCE:
- Reframe contribution to ONLY the fairness-bounded comparison (bounded-W vs unbounded-greedy vs SGLang-default vs VTC), NOT cache-aware admission itself. The claim must be rewritten.
- Head-to-head against SGLang's actual cache-aware scheduler (not FCFS) on real vLLM/SGLang with APC enabled, measuring wall-clock p50/p99 TTFT, throughput, KV-block eviction, and fairness under bursty agentic traffic with realistic heavy-tailed family skew (Zipf s≥1.5).
- Explicit comparison against VTC fairness-bounded scheduling to establish the bounded-W mechanism is not subsumed.
- Seeds ≥20 with multiple-comparison-corrected CI (Bonferroni or BH) on the win cells; per-cell fairness-ratio distribution (not just mean) at matched W.
- Sensitivity curve on cache-size vs K (continuous, not 3 discrete points) and on PREFIX_LEN/block_size.
- Test under realistic service-time feedback (prefill cost scales with missed tokens) — the constant-service-time assumption removes the very loop that determines whether matched-fairness survives on hardware.

MANDATORY_BASELINES:
- SGLang RadixAttention cache-aware scheduler (Zheng et al., NeurIPS 2024) — the direct mechanism collision
- vLLM with APC enabled, default scheduler — the dominant serving engine
- VTC / fairness-bounded LLM scheduling (Sheng et al., OSDI 2024) — the fairness-mechanism collision
- Preble prefix-aware scheduling (Srivatsa et al., 2024) — independent third source for core idea

